<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in New York as Dow loses 25 points.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in New York as Dow loses 25 points.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in New York, while the Dow Jones Index was down 25.68 points (-0.38 percent) by 7.50 a.m. NZT, to 6,807.11.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	 Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$18 1/8	  nil   *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 1/2	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$28 1/4	 -0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$20 3/8	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$12 7/8	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$36 1/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  180 p		nil</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  39 1/2		+1</p>
<p>Brierley	 London  untraded</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  234 1/2	   +0 1/2</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col  London  154		 +2 1/2</p>
<p>Templeton	London  143		 +1 1/2</p>
<p>Lion	     Sydney  A$3.12		+4</p>
<p>Goodman	  Sydney  A$1.71	     nil</p>
<p>Macraes	  Sydney  A$2.27		-3</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
